**If the cut still runs long:** first tighten pauses and shot lengths; then drop ", to keep her near" (19) and "still" (21); then ask the director, who cuts words, never beats.

The five strikes, for every position: 1 stove (lines 8–10, shots 7–8), 2 roast goose (11–12, shots 9–10), 3 Christmas tree → stars (13–15, shots 11–12), 4 grandmother (16–18, shots 13a–14), 5 the whole bundle (19–20, shots 15–16).
